  title: "Trolleybuses and Motor Buses \u2013 1920s "
  info: 'The introduction of trolleybuses and motorized buses revolutionized public
    transport in Singapore. Bus companies like the Singapore Traction Company began
    operating routes across the island, providing affordable and reliable services
    for commuters. Buses soon became the backbone of urban transport.  '
